{"id":"s20","label":"20. Cathedral","blocks":[{"k":"d","text":"SERVICE, ORGAN and ANTHEM."},{"k":"d","text":"MARGARET among much people: the EVIL SPIRIT behind MARGARET."},{"k":"s","text":"EVIL SPIRIT"},{"k":"v","lines":["How otherwise was it, Margaret,","When thou, still innocent,","Here to the altar cam’st,","And from the worn and fingered book","Thy prayers didst prattle,","Half sport of childhood,","Half God within thee!","Margaret!","Where tends thy thought?","Within thy bosom","What hidden crime?","Pray’st thou for mercy on thy mother’s soul,","That fell asleep to long, long torment, and through thee?","Upon thy threshold whose the blood?","And stirreth not and quickens","Something beneath thy heart,","Thy life disquieting","With most foreboding presence?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["Woe! woe!","Would I were free from the thoughts","That cross me, drawing hither and thither,","Despite me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"CHORUS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Dies iræ, dies illa,","Solvet sæclum in favilla!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Sound of the organ."},{"k":"s","text":"EVIL SPIRIT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Wrath takes thee!","The trumpet peals!","The graves tremble!","And thy heart","From ashy rest","To fiery torments","Now again requickened,","Throbs to life!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["Would I were forth!","I feel as if the organ here","My breath takes from me,","My very heart","Dissolved by the anthem!"]},{"k":"s","text":"CHORUS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Judex ergo cum sedebit,","Quidquid latet, adparebit,","Nil inultum remanebit."]},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["I cannot breathe!","The massy pillars","Imprison me!","The vaulted arches","Crush me!—Air!"]},{"k":"s","text":"EVIL SPIRIT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Hide thyself! Sin and shame","Stay never hidden.","Air? Light?","Woe to thee!"]},{"k":"s","text":"CHORUS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Quid sum miser tunc dicturus,","Quem patronem rogaturus,","Cum vix Justus sit securus?"]},{"k":"s","text":"EVIL SPIRIT"},{"k":"v","lines":["They turn their faces,","The glorified, from thee:","The pure, their hands to offer,","Shuddering, refuse thee!","Woe!"]},{"k":"s","text":"CHORUS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Quid sum miser tunc dicturus?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["Neighbor! your cordial!"]},{"k":"d","text":"She falls in a swoon."}]}